Part 1: kite_bronze_ingestor.py (Process 1 — Live WebSocket & Atomic Bronze Writer)

This ingestor splits your universe across 3 KiteTicker WebSocket connections (up to 9,000 tokens total), uses tenacity for resilient pre-market instrument dumps and automatic reconnection backoff, buffers incoming binary ticks in thread-safe queues, and flushes immutable ZSTD Parquet files every 60 seconds via AtomicParquetWriter.
